silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_02_bridge_to_olog_foundation_concrete_anchor_2#mittensforgeroutingfunctor silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeRoutingFunctor is In section 'Bridge to Olog Node-Arrow Foundation' the bare symbol TypingSentence anchors to MittensForgeRoutingFunctor: The routing functor R: F_04 to Backend that sends each typed source leg to a backend write target while preserving the leg's Yoneda profile (incoming and outgoing arrows)." .
